UC008 ..> UC007 : <<include>>
UC009 ..> UC007 : <<extend>>
UC025 ..> UC003 : <<include>>
UC026 ..> UC003 : <<include>>
UC027 ..> UC011 : <<extend>>
UC018 ..> UC007 : <<extend>> retroactive warning
UC015 ..> UC016 : <<include>> placing renumbers
